        {
          "description": "List the verified reviewer&#39;s team queue: OPEN cases ordered by reply-due time, with case_id, request, patient (first name + last initial), ward, opened time, age in hours, reply-due time, sla_status (ON_TRACK, DUE_SOON, OVERDUE) and requested days&#39; supply. Status EMPTY = no open cases; NOT_REVIEWER = not a reviewer token.",
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "get_review_queue",
            "handlerDescription": "List the verified reviewer's team queue: OPEN cases ordered by reply-due time, with case_id, request, patient (first name + last initial), ward, opened time, age in hours, reply-due time, sla_status (ON_TRACK, DUE_SOON, OVERDUE) and requested days' supply. Status EMPTY = no open cases; NOT_REVIEWER = not a reviewer token.",
