      "data": {
        "name": "get_followup_slots_flow",
        "description": "List the clinic slots that are eligible for a patient&#39;s follow-up visit: only OPEN slots of the specialty the discharge order asks for, inside the follow-up window. Each row: slot_id, weekday, date, time, part_of_day, location, clinician, wheelchair_accessible and transport_available (hospital wheelchair transport). If the patient cannot be booked, status says why (NO_FOLLOWUP_REQUIRED, ALREADY_BOOKED, DISCHARGE_NOT_ORDERED, NOT_FOUND, NONE_AVAILABLE) with a reason_text.",
